   Block: skeleton-media-card
   Title: SkeletonMediaCard
   Description: A React video media card skeleton with thumbnail, play button, and metadata built with Next.js, shadcn/ui, and Tailwind CSS
   Source: original/blocks/skeleton/skeleton-media-card.tsx
